From 681a77b1598ff0a9d5ec8c1470e8c5057ab73293 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 09:31:44 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] Respect native bounding shapes of stereo Xwayland children

Track ShapeNotify and retain native regions through independent child placement. Build each eye from its own clipped source region, including the one-eye X geometry used by GLX, and repaint changes without occluding ordinary UI through the other eye.

Advertise declaration version 9 for child-shape consumption. Add asymmetric, empty/reset, placement and ordinary X11 controls at normal and doubled scale. The new regression fails on the base and passes with this consumer; installed private-module captures preserve the ordinary sibling panel in both eyes.

Assisted-by: gpt-6-astra via Codex
